      "key": "t2ee8f20f6e1390b7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Yes, UpForex is a regulated forex broker, with official licenses granted by authorities in Saint Lucia and Mauritius. Specifically, UpForex Ltd is incorporated in Saint Lucia under registration number 2024‑00700, and its affiliated company in Mauritius—UP Global Markets Ltd—is licensed by the Financial Services Commission (FSC) Mauritius as an Investment Dealer (License No. GB23204579).</span>",
